    "title": "Insfocus - leading provider of business intelligence software",
    "introHtml": "<p>InsFocus utilized their extensive field experience and pre-built data model to develop a new methodology for structured insurance BI. </p><p>To better communicate their product and brand, they hired SPARK to rebrand their website and create a more engaging user experience. </p><p>By redesigning the brand focusing on UX writing to improve conversion and reduce information clutter. By creating a lean and concise website, we where able to provide a more user-friendly experience that helps potential customers better understand the value of their product.</p>",
